# Code conventions

- Use `type`, not `interface`. No `any`.
- React 19 ref-as-prop. No `forwardRef`. Destructure `ref` before `...props`. Set `displayName` on exported components.
- Biome formats and lints. Import order: external packages, blank line, relative imports.
- PascalCase component files under `src/components/`.
- Colors only via CSS variables and Tailwind 4 `bg-(--color-*)` form. No hex in components. Tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css`.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` with Motion `useReducedMotion`.
- User-facing strings in `src/sounds.ts` and `src/copy.ts`, not scattered in JSX.
